  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irrigated Agriculture and Onion Storage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Onion/Vegetables Beneficiaries: 1491 (1378 women) Description: The project will install solar pumping systems to improve members&apos; access to water to increase the area of crops under irrigated production from 13.5 ha to 18 ha; obtain training in best production and post-harvest handling practices for onions to increase yields; and construct a warehouse to stock onions to defer sales to obtain higher prices. The project will also build the cooperative management&apos;s business skills and overall capacity, and will result in the production of a sustainability plan for the organization.</narrative>
  </description>
